# Optional local development settings; never commit a real .env or credentials.
# Production LaunchAgent reads ~/.local/share/personal-ai/server.env instead.
PORT=4310
# WORKSPACE_DATA_DIR=/absolute/local/path/personal-ai-data
# WORKSPACE_PASSWORD=at-least-16-private-characters
# Exact HTTPS origin only. Tailscale Serve must preserve Host and forward HTTPS.
# WORKSPACE_PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://your-mac-mini.your-tailnet.ts.net
# Existing OpenCode wins; pinned project-local engine is the last fallback.
# OPENCODE_BIN=/absolute/path/to/existing/opencode
# OPENCODE_CONFIG=/absolute/private/path/opencode.json
# To attach to an existing authenticated loopback server instead of launching:
# OPENCODE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4096
# OPENCODE_SERVER_PASSWORD=your-existing-local-server-password
# OPENCODE_SERVER_USERNAME=opencode
# Optional diagnostic CLI path:
# TAILSCALE_BIN=/Applications/Tailscale.app/Contents/MacOS/Tailscale
